# GD-2 (round 19): L §3.1 `monthday`: "A day of the year without its year (13 April). `02-29` is no month-day ...
# (refused, `LOAD-PARSE`). Month-days compare with `==` and `!=` only; any order or arithmetic on them is refused (§8.4)."
# max orders its arguments (L §5.11): max over month-days is an order the type lacks, LOAD-UNIT (L §8.4).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index yrs = year 2026..2027
input file_by: monthday
input other: monthday
def m: monthday = max(file_by, other)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  file_by = 04-30
  other = 04-30
ask q: m
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT max orders month-days: they compare with == and != only (m.tally:12)
